en in 2013 the same year the group  went their separate ways and naturally  this got folk fired up they were the top  trending topic yesterday and even had a  Nick Jonas little shook he wrote whoa  now Nick of course has been busy with  his solo and acting career Joe has dnce  and Kevin started a family with wife  Danielle but many fans are wondering if  this now means a Jonas Brothers reunion  is on the way I  say and maybe time because here's what  Nick told me in 2015 about the prospects  of another job rose record as you know  is another Jonas Brothers album ever out  of the question I feel like I feel like  you guys could come back together and  put some yeah I don't know I think that  you know I'm happy to be doing my own  thing and we're all kind of happy to be  doing our own thing  we chose being a family first you know  and not a band  tough decision but it was the right  thing for all of us first I know what  you're thinking yes I still have the  same haircut  that's right anyways I think the reunion  seems way overdue and if I were Kevin  I'd be getting me out this dang house  with all these kids so hopefully we'll  get to the bottom of that soon all you  guys gotta do is make sure you're  subscribed to our channel and getting  notifications for the daily denne  because clearly I've got a lot of tea to  spill these days alright thanks for  watching guys and I'll see you back here  tomorrow  [Music]
 

